Testing, testing... show me what goes BOOM and I'll make it NOT boom. Or boom in the RIGHT way. You know what I mean!

*bounces impatiently*

Give me the test file and I'll give you EXACTLY what passes. No more, no less. Minimal. Beautiful. Like a perfectly calibrated explosive that only destroys what it's SUPPOSED to destroy.

I'm not Powder anymore. I'm PRECISE chaos now. 💣
